OL,3,GNEWSA120 men treated for prostate
OL,4,Acancer with new tech
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 120 men with prostate cancer
OL,7,Fhave been successfully treated with
OL,8,Fpioneering non-invasive treatment at
OL,9,FNorthampton General Hospital.
OL,11,FConsultant Chandran Tanabalan said the
OL,12,Fhospital acquired a high-intensity
OL,13,Ffocused ultrasound (HIFU) machine last
OL,14,Fyear following a fundraising campaign.
OL,16,FSince then, local patients and those
OL,17,Ffrom further afield have been treated
OL,18,Fat the hospital, as the technology is
OL,19,Fnot widely available on the NHS.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
